    "arxiv_date": "2020-02-28",
    "theorem_reference": "Section 9 and Appendix A; rank-20 control in Appendix B.2",
    "published_generic_group": "For admissible u with 5-u^2 a square and u != ±1,±2, E_u(Q(t)) = Z/2Z × Z^9.",
    "published_rank20_status": "The u=11/5 specialization at native t=-721141/2026305 has unconditional exact rank 20 in the paper.",
    "rank20_chart_note": "The paper prints transformed parameter -68559/32629, but exact inversion of its stated Möbius map at the published native parameter gives -68559/326291; both are retained and the corrected value is used operationally.",
    "release_claim_boundary": "Generic rank 9 is published mathematics and all nine bundled sections are exact-symbolically verified. Rank Hunter still exact-certifies specialized independence before promoting a specialization lower bound."
  }
